
  <sn><md>### Connecting Free Mega Account

- Go to this website https://temp-mail.org/en/
- Then go to mega sign up page and create account with this email
- Check inbox of temp mail page from mega and complete sign up process
- Now u get free 20gb storage
- Refresh mail in temp mail and u get more account


